"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Alcohol","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Caffeine","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cannabis","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cocaine","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Gbl","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Ghb","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Ketamine","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Methoxetamine","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Opioids","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Psychedelics","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[{"title":"Comparison of intranasal methamphetamine and d-amphetamine self-administration by humans.","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22050030"},{"title":"Methamphetamine or desoxyn should not be used within 14 days of using a MAOI drug - Mosby's Dental Drug Reference Ninth Edition 2010"},{"title":"Meth/desoxyn usage for long periods of time in children or people who have not finished growing will cause temporary suppression of weight and height growth - Mosby's Dental Drug Reference 9th Ed. 2010"}],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Methamphetamine"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/methamphetamine"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_Methamphetamine.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methamphetamine"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on Methamphetamine","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q44909815"}],"wikidata":"Q44909815","pharmacology":{"text":"Methamphetamine has been identified as a potent full agonist of trace amine-associated receptor 1 (TAAR1), a G protein-coupled receptor (GPCR) that regulates brain catecholamine systems. Activation of TAAR1 increases cyclic adenosine monophosphate (cAMP) production and either completely inhibits or reverses the transport direction of the dopamine transporter (DAT), norepinephrine transporter (NET), and serotonin transporter (SERT).","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Methamphetamine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methamphetamine#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Stimulant; Serotonin–norepinephrine–dopamine releasing agent","body":[{"what":"halfLife","says":"9–12 hours (range 5–30 hours); irrespective of route"},{"what":"brokenDown","says":"CYP2D6 and FMO3"},{"what":"turnsInto","says":"Amphetamine; Pholedrine; N-Hydroxymethamphetamine; Norephedrine"},{"what":"leaves","says":"Primarily kidney"}],"figures":"Methamphetamine"},"uses":{"text":"Methamphetamine is a central nervous system (CNS) stimulant that is primarily used as a recreational or performance-enhancing drug and less commonly as a second-line treatment for attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD). It has also been researched as a potential treatment for traumatic brain injury.","recreational":"Methamphetamine is often used recreationally for its effects as a potent euphoriant and stimulant as well as aphrodisiac qualities. A subculture known as party and play is based around sexual activity and methamphetamine use. Participants in this subculture, which consists mostly of homosexual male methamphetamine users, will typically meet up through internet dating sites and have sex.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Methamphetamine","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methamphetamine","brands":"Desoxyn","routes":"By mouth, intravenous, intramuscular, subcutaneous, inhalation, insufflation, rectal, vaginal","figures":"Methamphetamine"},"formula":"C10H15N","molarMass":149.23}